  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<h1>Athena</h1>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\">\n<p style=\"display:inline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://images.teamresourceful.com/r/I80VLV.svg?compress=false\" alt=\"由 Terrarium 製作\" width=\"155\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fstitch\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/indium\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://images.teamresourceful.com/r/dCVaUA.svg?compress=false\" alt=\"若無 Indium，會與 Sodium 衝突\" width=\"234\" height=\"56\"></a></p>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\">\n<h2>📖介紹📖</h2>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></div><p>Athena 是一款多功能、跨平台的 baked model 載入器，內建對連接紋理的支援。它為每種類型使用獨特的 baked model，以確保最佳效能與跨平台相容性。Athena 的連接紋理方法（CTM）專為這些模型設計，以減少不必要的計算並解決常見問題。此外，Athena 允許自訂檢查，例如對玻璃片進行特殊的垂直剔除，進一步增強其功能。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.terrarium.earth%252fstitch\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/documentation/gitbook_vector.svg\" alt=\"GitBook 文件\" height=\"56\"> </a></p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fterrarium\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;</a><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\">\n<h2>✨社群媒體✨</h2>\n<p style=\"display:inline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutube.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/youtube-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/terrariumearth\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/twitch-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Twitch\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftwitter.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/twitter-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Twitter\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkofi.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/kofi-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fTerrarium\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/terrariumearth/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></p>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"> 本模組的標誌使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flucide.dev%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lucide Icons</a> 製作 <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></div>",
